OL,3,GNEWSAI lost my job in a primary school
OL,4,Adue to endometriosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FHayley Locksley was 11 years old when
OL,7,Fshe started her periods and
OL,8,Fexcruciating pain became part of her
OL,9,Flife.
OL,11,F"I used to spend every month in the
OL,12,Fsick room at school," she says.
OL,14,FHayley, from Shefford, Bedfordshire,
OL,15,Fwould often pass out from the pain but
OL,16,Fthe doctors' advice was to take
OL,17,Fparacetamol.
