OL,3,GNEWSAI lost my job in a primary school
OL,4,Adue to endometriosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FAged 24, she was diagnosed with
OL,7,Fendometriosis - a condition that
OL,8,Faffects one in 10 women, where tissue
OL,9,Fsimilar to the lining of the womb grows
OL,10,Foutside of the uterus.
